n-preview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/migration-preview#相依模組重要變更","content":"**Express 5**：","locale":"zh-TW"},"95":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/migration-preview-18","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/migration-preview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/migration-preview#相依模組重要變更","content":"路由處理函式現在原生支援回傳 Promise，未捕捉之例外會自動傳遞至錯誤處理中介軟體（Error Handler Middleware）。","locale":"zh-TW"},"96":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/migration-preview-19","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/migration-preview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/migration-preview#相依模組重要變更","content":"若您在客製化外掛（Plugins）中有定義自己的路由中介軟體，請檢查是否相容 Express 5 的路由簽名。","locale":"zh-TW"},"97":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/migration-preview-20","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/migration-preview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/migration-preview#相依模組重要變更","content":"**fhir-tool 5.0.2**：","locale":"zh-TW"},"98":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/migration-preview-21","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/migration-preview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/migration-preview#相依模組重要變更","content":"替換舊版 `fhir` 套件，模組命名空間全面統一為 `fhir-tool`。","locale":"zh-TW"},"99":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/migration-preview-22","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/migration-preview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/migration-preview#2-雙資料庫配置dual-database-setup","content":"在 v2 中，所有資源與歷史版本皆存放在單一 MongoDB 資料庫中；在 v3 中，建議採用雙資料庫架構以獲得最佳吞吐量。","locale":"zh-TW"},"100":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/migration-preview-23","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/migration-preview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/migration-preview#環境變數設定-env","content":"在 `.env` 中新增或確認以下連線字串：","locale":"zh-TW"},"101":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/migration-preview-24","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/migration-preview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/migration-preview#環境變數設定-env","content":"> **注意**：若未特別指定 `TEMPORAL_MONGODB_URI`，Burni 仍可相容於單一資料庫模式，但建議生產環境分離以發揮完整效能。","locale":"zh-TW"},"102":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/migration-preview-25","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/migration-preview","tags":[],"typ