` 集合）、HTTP 請求關聯紀錄與 Provenance 審計資料。","locale":"zh-TW"},"148":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/temporal-architecture-13","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/temporal-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/temporal-architecture#1-職責分離-separation-of-concerns","content":"針對時間序列（Timestamp）、版本編號（`versionId`）進行複合索引優化。","locale":"zh-TW"},"149":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/temporal-architecture-14","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/temporal-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/temporal-architecture#2-資料一致性與-provenance-保證","content":"在 v3 中，針對資源更新的歷史歸檔流程進行了精準強化：","locale":"zh-TW"},"150":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/temporal-architecture-15","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/temporal-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/temporal-architecture#2-資料一致性與-provenance-保證","content":"**BundleRequest Provenance 保全**：確保在交易（Transaction）與批次操作下，每個版本都能完整對應到發起請求的 HTTP 標頭與使用者識別。","locale":"zh-TW"},"151":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/temporal-architecture-16","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/temporal-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/temporal-architecture#2-資料一致性與-provenance-保證","content":"**vread 操作精確回溯**：即便資源已經過多次更新或甚至邏輯刪除，客戶端依舊能透過 `[baseUrl]/[type]/[id]/_history/[vid]` 快速且零延遲地從 Temporal DB 讀取當時的快照。","locale":"zh-TW"},"152":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/temporal-architecture-17","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/temporal-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/temporal-architecture#營運與維護優勢","content":"**分級儲存 (Tiered Storage)**：","locale":"zh-TW"},"153":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/temporal-architecture-18","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/temporal-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/temporal-architecture#營運與維護優勢","content":"Primary DB 可配置高 IOPS 的 NVMe SSD，Temporal DB 則可配置具備成本效益的大容量儲存媒體，大幅節約雲端基礎設施成本。","locale":"zh-TW"},"154":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/temporal-architecture-19","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/temporal-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/temporal-architecture#營運與維護優勢","content":"**獨立備份策略**：","locale":"zh-TW"},"155":{"id":"/z